OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear spells and a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers this evening. The showers
OL,8,Fbecoming mainly confined to northern
OL,9,Fand western areas overnight. A cooler
OL,10,Fnight than last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,13,Ffor many with sunny spells. A few
OL,14,Fshowers will develop, especially near
OL,15,FIrish Sea coasts. Feeling rather warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
