OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Freturns on Friday, potentially heavy
OL,7,Ffor a time. A risk of some further
OL,8,Frain on Saturday before turning drier
OL,9,Fand brighter on Sunday. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average for early October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
